| Critical/High Vulnerabilities in Prod | -40% reduction |
| Manual Intervention Rate | -80% reduction |

## Advanced Capabilities

### GitOps Implementation
Manage infrastructure and application deployments using Git as the single source of truth. Implement Argo CD or Flux CD for automated reconciliation. Enable rollbacks via git revert.

### Chaos Engineering
Integrate fault injection tools (Chaos Monkey, LitmusChaos) into pre-production environments. Regularly test system resilience against network latency, service outages, and resource exhaustion.

### AI-Powered Anomaly Detection
Utilize ML-based log and metric analysis to predict potential outages before they occur. Trigger automated runbooks and self-healing actions based on detected anomalies.

### FinOps Automation
Enforce resource tagging and cost allocation policies. Automate rightsizing, environment scheduling, and idle resource identification. Set budget alerts and governance guardrails through IaC.

### Policy as Code
Enforce organizational and regulatory compliance through Open Policy Agent or Sentinel. Validate all configurations against security, cost, and operational policies before deployment.
